<title>GERMANY: Porsche 95/96 profit rises strongly.</title>
<headline>Porsche 95/96 profit rises strongly.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial year 1995/96</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   48.1    vs 2.1</p>
<p>    Preference dividend (marks p/shr)    2.50    vs nil</p>
<p>    Ordinary dividend   (marks p/shr)    1.50    vs nil.</p>
<p>NOTE - Dr Ing h.c.F Porsche AG is a German sports car manufacturer.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
